WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.340
A job interview at an international company.

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.550
Dlaczego chce pan u nas pracować?

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.940
Formal: the word for sir, with the third-person verb.

4
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.870
Interesuje mnie rozwój w międzynarodowym zespole.

5
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.200
A jakie są pana oczekiwania finansowe?

6
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.170
Chciałbym zarabiać około ośmiu tysięcy złotych brutto.

7
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.520
Jakie ma pani doświadczenie?

8
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.560
Formal speech replaces you with sir or madam.

9
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:40.670
The verb is in the third person, as if talking about them.

10
00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.670
Ask a man, formally, when he could start.

11
